  "details": "I see this question pop up in the help channels once in a while which I think is due to confusing wording.\nWhen in play mode the SDK window says\n\"Unity Application is running...\"\n\"Stop it to access the Control Panel\"\nIt's confusing because it gives off the impression that the editor is running.. which, it does.. you're looking at it.\nI think instead it should something like:\n\"Unity is in Play mode...\"\n\"Exit play mode to access the Control Panel\"",
